{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "86",
   "text": "If U.S.-China trade tensions escalate, will China keep the yuan stable or let it weaken?",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "question",
   "toulmin": "framing",
   "oper": "framing",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#Q"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "87",
   "text": "Reserves, capital controls, and policy tools give Beijing substantial exchange-rate control",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#P1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "88",
   "text": "A weaker yuan lets exporters lower dollar prices while preserving yuan revenue",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#P2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "89",
   "text": "A stable currency supports confidence and reduces financial risk",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#P3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "90",
   "text": "25% on nearly $550B of imports could raise roughly $100–140B",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "91",
   "text": "UBS: full tariffs plus retaliation could cut growth by about 1.5pp",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "92",
   "text": "No sustained pressure in either direction",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "93",
   "text": "Large reserves, state-bank foreign assets, and portfolio inflows",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "94",
   "text": "Trade surplus covers major outflows without sustained reserve pressure",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D5"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "95",
   "text": "Further export-oriented adjustment would matter globally",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#D6"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "96",
   "text": "Higher U.S. import costs reduce competitiveness and growth",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#M1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "97",
   "text": "A weaker yuan offsets part of the tariff in dollar terms",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#M2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "98",
   "text": "Avoiding a large currency move limits financial instability",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#M3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "99",
   "text": "Other Asian currencies weaken and trade pressure shifts globally",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#M4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "100",
   "text": "It is not mechanically forced into depreciation",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#C1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "101",
   "text": "Exporters can preserve competitiveness",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#C2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "102",
   "text": "It risks instability and additional U.S. retaliation",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#C3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "103",
   "text": "Export-dependent economies outside China also come under pressure",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#C4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "104",
   "text": "Beijing can defend stability or reset the yuan lower; its decision will shape the global impact of the trade war",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "main_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#K"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "105",
   "text": "China can support growth fiscally without risking a destabilizing currency move",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "counterpoint",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#X"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "106",
   "text": "Controlled depreciations are difficult because markets may front-run them",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#QF"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "107",
   "text": "A weaker yuan could trigger broader or higher U.S. tariffs",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#R1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "108",
   "text": "Tariffs and oil prices could push China toward current-account deficit",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_may_10_19#R2"
  },
